  "summary": "ATLANTA, Aug. 17, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Gray Media, Inc. (“Gray,” “we,” “us” or “our”) (NYSE: GTN) announced today that it intends to offer up to $750 million aggregate principal amount of senior secured first lien notes due 2034, subject to market conditions.",
